Subject: [PATCH 02/10] arm: Use clear_tasks_mm_cpumask()
Message-ID: <20120324102808.GB29067@lizard>
References: <20120324102609.GA28356@lizard>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
